      "2": {
        "attributes": {
          "font-size": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 19
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "INLETS\n\n• Write\nSend in a trigger to write a pitch bend message of the current bend value.\n\n• Channel\nThe desired MIDI channel to write to (hidden by default).\n\n• Bend\nThe amount of bend to send out. This value is normalized by default but this can be disabled in the Inspector."
          }
        },
        "bounds": {
          "height": 297,
          "width": 312,
          "x": 214.958984375,
