          "text": {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "ATTRIBUTES\n\n• Normalize\nThe bend input is normalized by default (it wants a -1 to 1 float value). You can disable this if you want. In this case the node requires an 14-bit signed integer signal between -8192 and 8191.\n\n"
          }
